{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on request 021f37dd: the extension is authorized. Do not\nmake these acts `unavailable`.\n\nReason. Section 5.4 of the note gives `{ entry }` so that the Grow\nacts stay explorable. A command record keyed by the entry is the\nsame commit input in another position. `set-fan`, `set-heater`,\n`set-vent` and `authorize` are the acts that an agent explores\nmost in Grow.\n\nBounds.\n1. The positions are those that hold the entry's own reference,\n   `given.self`, in a record that a capability effect writes. The\n   capability effect marks them. Use that provenance only. Compare\n   no number with a guessed sequence.\n2. The body returns these marks through the same private result as\n   the `from: self` indexes of ruling ef1fc932. No second export,\n   no Contract type, no new symbolic family. The runtime passes no\n   callback and its draft bytes stay equal.\n3. `packages/client` keeps the record effects in a private overlay\n   with one alias for each source. A marked position shows as\n   `{ entry: Source }` wherever the view exposes it.\n4. The hypothetical view gives the exact record count and the\n   exact reservations after the act.\n5. The coarse rule of section 5.4 applies. A later judgment that\n   reads the value of a marked position answers `unavailable`\n   until the source's entry. A judgment that reads only counts or\n   reservations proceeds.\n6. `device-command` is the one capability in scope. The E1 note\n   names each capability effect that writes `given.self`. If\n   another one does, it answers `unavailable` and you tell me.\n\nTest. One case under invariant 9: explore a Grow room act that\nopens a command, submit the same act to the in-memory scope, and\ncompare the record count and the reservations of the hypothetical\nview with the scope's state. Add one case at the reservation\nbound: the exploration on the hypothetical view refuses as the\nscope refuses the second act.","body":{"stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:021f37dd26e6de49f5bb15e832154f716061b001 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:02c1227e7dc1c04a96ab423dd34c58537b63a2f2, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:03c2d3b4bab05912804bc48129712cd98f805758, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:06d96cd732ff547fa8959619d6df87c5953f2ded, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0d76705dfdd74d8de0047a7a257da83b75d575e2 and 73 more","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}